{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_architecture_constitution", "label": "CLAUDE.md \u2014 Mimari Anayasa", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_platform_concept", "label": "Bilgi \u00d6d\u00fcld\u00fcr Platform Konsepti", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kitaplar sat\u0131lmaz, emekle a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r: oku \u2192 \u00fcret (yaz\u0131/quiz/g\u00f6rev) \u2192 puan kazan \u2192 yeni kitap a\u00e7. Medium (edit\u00f6r/takip/be\u011feni), Skool (feed/seviye/harita), Kahoot (s\u00fcreli quiz) ve Jira (Kanban) desenlerini tek platformda birle\u015ftirme karar\u0131."}, {"id": "claude_static_book_pages", "label": "Statik Kitap Sayfalar\u0131 Karar\u0131", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "884 kitap sayfas\u0131 getStaticPaths ile statik kal\u0131r (SEO + h\u0131z + Pagefind aranabilirli\u011fi); t\u00fcm dinamik davran\u0131\u015f server island'a itilerek statik sayfalar korunur."}, {"id": "claude_okuma_kapisi_server_island", "label": "OkumaKapisi Server Island", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_drive_leak_guard", "label": "Drive S\u0131z\u0131nt\u0131 Bek\u00e7isi (Misafir DOM Kural\u0131)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Misafir DOM'unda Drive iframe/link olmamal\u0131; tests/e2e/gate.spec.ts bek\u00e7i. Ger\u00e7ek koruma Drive izinlerinde \u2014 site yaln\u0131zca vitrin kap\u0131s\u0131d\u0131r (fileId tahmin edilebilir oldu\u011fundan URL gizlili\u011fine g\u00fcvenilmez)."}, {"id": "claude_points_ledger_single_source", "label": "points_ledger Tek Ger\u00e7ek Kaynak", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Puan bakiyesi ayr\u0131 bir kolonda tutulmaz; t\u00fcm kazan\u0131m/harcama ledger sat\u0131r\u0131d\u0131r (harcamalar negatif). Seviyeler toplam KAZANILANDAN hesaplan\u0131r."}, {"id": "claude_award_points_gateway", "label": "awardPoints() Puan Kap\u0131s\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ledger'a do\u011frudan insert yasak; tek kap\u0131 awardPoints() olmal\u0131 ki streak, seviye a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131mlar\u0131 (3/5/7) ve rozetler her puan olay\u0131nda tutarl\u0131 tetiklensin."}, {"id": "claude_economy_guards", "label": "Ekonomi Korumalar\u0131 (economy.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Be\u011feni \u00e7iftli\u011fini frenlemek i\u00e7in ayn\u0131 ki\u015fiden g\u00fcnde 5 puanl\u0131 be\u011feni; kul\u00fcp g\u00f6rev \u00f6d\u00fcl\u00fcne haftal\u0131k 1000 puan tavan\u0131 (otomatik k\u0131rp\u0131l\u0131r)."}, {"id": "claude_bilgi_hazinesi_onboarding", "label": "Bilgi Hazinesi Onboarding", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kay\u0131tta 5 kitap se\u00e7ilir, ilki hediye (learning_list); kalanlar 200 puana /api/uye/kitap-ac ile a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r \u2014 kullan\u0131c\u0131ya somut, kilitli bir hedef listesi vererek \u00fcretim d\u00f6ng\u00fcs\u00fcn\u00fc ba\u015flat\u0131r."}, {"id": "claude_league_season_system", "label": "Lig/Sezon Sistemi (league.ts)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kul\u00fcp skoru = pozitif katk\u0131 \u00f7 \u221a\u00fcye: b\u00fcy\u00fck kul\u00fcplerin s\u0131rf \u00fcye say\u0131s\u0131yla kazanmas\u0131n\u0131 engelleyen normalizasyon. aktifSezon() ay\u0131 otomatik a\u00e7ar."}, {"id": "claude_daily_cron", "label": "G\u00fcnl\u00fck Cron (/api/cron/gunluk)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "QStash yerine Vercel Cron se\u00e7ildi (daha az ba\u011f\u0131ml\u0131l\u0131k); endpoint tetikleyici-ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z yaz\u0131ld\u0131 ve cron_runs idempotency ile \u00e7ifte tetik/retry g\u00fcvenli. \u0130\u015fler: bayat g\u00f6rev, sezon kapan\u0131\u015f/a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131\u015f, ay\u0131n kitab\u0131, \u00f6zel lig kapan\u0131\u015f\u0131."}, {"id": "claude_qa_gate", "label": "npm run qa Kalite Kap\u0131s\u0131", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_deger_notlari", "label": "NotebookLM De\u011fer Notu \u00dcretimi", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Kitap sayfalar\u0131ndaki \ud83d\udc8e de\u011fer kartlar\u0131 NotebookLM MCP notebook_query ile \u00fcretilir (deger-notlari.json); 884 kitap i\u00e7in batch i\u015f bekliyor (nb-sor.py hatt\u0131)."}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_architecture_constitution", "target": "docs_agents_issue_tracker_github_issue_conventions", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "CLAUDE.md", "source_location": null, "weight"